Dialogue: 0,0:22:45.80,0:22:49.00,Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,600)}即使夏日已過
Dialogue: 0,0:22:49.20,0:22:53.10,Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,600)}記憶中的笑顏
Dialogue: 0,0:22:53.30,0:22:59.90,Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,600)}牽連著至今的幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:23:00.20,0:23:05.50,Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,600)}啊  對自己坦率的意義
Dialogue: 0,0:23:05.80,0:23:13.80,Default2,NTP,0,0,0,,{\fad(200,600)}已深入心靈的深處
